```console
$ scherzo-cloud runner pool --help
Manage Scherzo Cloud runner pools

Usage: scherzo-cloud runner pool [COMMAND]

Commands:
  create  Create a Scherzo Cloud runner pool
  list    List Scherzo Cloud runner pools
  show    Show a Scherzo Cloud runner pool
  rename  Rename a Scherzo Cloud runner pool
  delete  Delete an unused Scherzo Cloud runner pool
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
